    - target: {fileID: 3620801043962550102, guid: 3abfeaa395ddfff458a7e4eabe65e4a3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Text
      value: 'That''s Correct!



        Rolling a die - Mutually Exclusive

        You
        cannot roll 3 and 1 at the same time, so these events are mutually exclusive.



        Choosing
        a day - Non-Mutually Exclusive

        A day like Monday can be both a weekday
        and start with the letter M, so these events are non-mutually exclusive.



        Tossing
        a coin - Mutually Exclusive

        A coin toss results in either heads
        or tails, not both, so these events are mutually exclusive.

'
